# NomadLink product

Full spec: `docs/NOMADLINK-STRATEGIA.md`

- **Pure brokerage**, not a tour operator. No coordinators, no destination logistics, no standing between user and suppliers.
- Value: organize a group trip yourself, book at market rates, spend less than traditional operators.
- Flow: LOGIN → **CREA un Trip** | **ESPLORA i Trip**. Book flights/hotels/cars/attractions **only after the group reaches the soglia del gruppo**.
- CREA: templates first (anti cold-start), then modify or from scratch. Duration remaps the itinerary (drop secondary stops when days shrink). Publish as **In formazione** + soglia del gruppo.
- ESPLORA: filters, In evidenza (boost), In chiusura (real FOMO), join CTA, creator trust (profile, rating, reviews).
- Budget copy is always **Budget orientativo** / stima. Never “prezzo del viaggio” or “costo del pacchetto”.
- Onboarding: max 3 steps + model explainer, then forced Crea / Esplora. No name/age at the start.
- Copy in Italian, catchy, high contrast on photo backgrounds (paper form controls).
- Do not reintroduce “book services right after create”.
